# Chapter IV, the Forsaken Land: Herbert the peddler offers to travel with the
# player to Gron. On the way he fetches his goods from a house in Gor, the
# dead rise, and the two escape through the old house's fireplace and the
# caves beneath before reaching Gron.
# Position stands in for the walk to where Herbert waits; once he follows the
# player (AIFollow), the player walks. Ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from herbert_meet
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Herbert hails the player in the wasteland and offers to travel together.
case herbert_meet
run
player->Position -85092 4567 323 180
# He hails the player within 400 (HerbertScript State 1 -> 2), wherever he has wandered: approach him.
approach 054CBD39
until 900 "Herbert".State == 2
wait 30
ask travel with me
choose 2
choose 3
choose 4
choose 5
choose 6
choose 7
choose 8
choose 9
choose 10
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Herbert == 1
end

# In sight of Gor, Herbert tells of the goods he stored there. Rats near the
# meeting place attack, and a player in combat runs no walk. Herbert follows,
# so the player walks the whole road with him; past the dock it is steered at
# the controls in straight runs along the navmesh over the rocks, as the
# engine's route for an AI-driven player turns down into the Gor lake.
case herbert_gor
defend
walk -72441 5203 54
steer -71950 5454 124
steer -71692 6250 139
steer -70167 6988 468
steer -68870 7262 167
steer -68693 7482 163
until 1800 "Herbert".State == 3
wait 30
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Herbert == 2
end

# At the house on the hillside he goes in alone; Herbert follows, so the player walks there: to the
# GorScript02 marker, which moves the quest on once Herbert is within 300 of it.
case herbert_house
defend
walk -66699 421 685
until 1800 "Herbert".State == 5
wait 30
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Herbert == 3
end

# The dead crawl out of the houses; Herbert comes back with the key.
case herbert_dead_rise
walk -67270 1253 248
until 600 "Herbert".State == 6
wait 30
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Herbert == 4
expect player->GetItemCount Key_Herbert == 1
end

# Into the old house, down through the fireplace, and out of the caves. The
# dead's own script sets Herbertvar back to 3 whenever one is near the player,
# so the cells, not Herbertvar, say how far the escape got.
case herbert_escape
defend
walk -66775 308 660
until 900 "Herbert"->GetDistance player < 600
activate 05EF6AC6
until 600 GetPCCell "Gor, Old House" == 1
walk -8 68 -103
activate 05DB3087
until 600 GetPCCell "Gor, Passage" == 1
walk 2414 -2757 -197
until 900 "Herbert"->GetDistance player < 600
activate 05B9E22B
until 600 GetPCCell "Gor, Passage" == 0
end

# Gron at last; Herbert takes his leave by the inn. The wolves on the road
# hunt the player, and Herbert's companion script returns while his weapon is
# drawn, so the fight is fought first; damage stands in for it.
case herbert_gron
defend
walk -62594 -2424 2620
walk -62181 516 1755
walk -64892 5544 1377
walk -62385 11683 891
walk -51438 11075 544
walk -47046 9735 128
wait 120
console 05984D48.damageav health 10000
console 0534E741.damageav health 10000
console 05BE56A9.damageav health 10000
console 0578FB32.damageav health 10000
console 053B0778.damageav health 10000
until 600 "Herbert".State == 7
wait 30
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Herbert == 5
end
